DESCRIPTION:FREE ENTRY WITH TICKET PURCHASE TO 1PM WITCHES BRUNCH\n
 \nJamie Shriner is what would happen if Bo Burnham and Jenna Marbles were c
 ryogenically frozen together in a pair of cat lady glasses. A former theatr
 e kid\, current queer & hard of hearing divorcé\, Jamie uses humorous orig
 inal songs to discuss her struggles with divorce\, body image\, hearing los
 s\, womanhood\, and being queer in Indiana where she grew up.\n\nJamie was 
 named Best of the Fest at Kenan Thompson’s Road To New York\, Big Pine Co
 medy Festival\, Laughs After Dark Comedy Festival and is a regular feature 
 at Zanies and Laugh Factory Chicago. The host and producer of Cast Party ha
 s opened for the likes of Beth Stelling\, Randy Feltface\, and Chrissy Chla
 pecka\, and is a former Features Contributor for The Onion. Her comedy spec
 ials\, Corn Baby\, Good Grief\, and The Nightmare Factory are available to 
 stream on YouTube\, Spotify\, iTunes\, and more.\n\nAges 17+\n\nFee applies
  if transferring confirmed ticket purchase to another guest.\n\nDoors for o
 pen for seating approximately 30 minutes before late showtimes. Please note
 \, doors are subject to prior show endtime and may change without notice\, 
 beyond our control.\n\nNo refunds or exchanges.\n\nTicket resale is strictl
 y prohibited. Any tickets purchased or listed on a third-party resale websi
 te or platform is a direct violation of our Venue Policies and will not be 
 honored\, resulting in denied admission. Third party resale websites and pl
 atforms include but are not limited to StubHub\, Vivid Seats\, Seat Geek\, 
 eTickets\, Event Tickets Center\, GoTickets\, Craigslist\, OfferUp\, Facebo
 ok Marketplace\, etc.\n\nWaitlists are available for sold out shows. To joi
 n the Waitlist\, you must be present at the venue prior to showtime on the 
 day of the event. You will need to provide your name and how many tickets y
 ou'd like to purchase. About 10-15 minutes after the show starts\, we will 
 go through our showroom and find the empty seats available and sell tickets
  in order of arrival.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/even
 t/musical-comedy-workshop-w-jamie-shriner/
